      "id": 195941,
      "name": "Dandolo",
      "username": "Dandolo",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dandolo/{size}/1845_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-04-14T13:02:49.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>…That’s hilarious and I’ve never thought of doing it.Though at least standard VG Idealist wouldn’t be able to do anything. Or Writhe, off the top of my head.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Idealist let’s you draw a card… Sentai does nothing though.</p>\n<p>Base Writhe does nothing but 5 extra HP might actually be better than his other powers… Cosmic Inventor would be hilariously broken.</p>\n<p>Both Mainstay’s would be really powerful, their powers are about on par with Adamant Sentinels Mainstay but the HP is almost double.</p>\n<p>Medico has 10 more health but a weaker power. Malpractice plus Hippocratic Oath would cause the universe to collapse upon itself  (which I think means OblivAeon automatically wins even if he’s not in the game).</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
